Parakeet conversion tools for AnySpeechRecognizer

This directory contains code derived from möbius by Fluid Inference
(https://github.com/FluidInference/mobius), commit
26f5fa8059d5ab3d34449adce6ff6ed86734e522, licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0 (http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).

Derived files and their sources:

- parakeet.py: component wrappers from
  models/stt/parakeet-tdt-v3-0.6b/coreml/individual_components.py;
  parameter name mapping and weight loading from
  models/stt/parakeet-redux/coreml/redux_weights.py.
- convert.py: conversion and quantization steps from
  models/stt/parakeet-tdt-v3-0.6b/coreml/convert-parakeet.py,
  models/stt/parakeet-redux/coreml/export_decoder_joint.py, and
  models/stt/parakeet-ultra/coreml/quantize_encoder_int8.py.

The files were modified for AnySpeechRecognizer.
The modifications are licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The tools do not contain model weights.
The models they convert are licensed separately under CC BY 4.0:

- Parakeet TDT 0.6B v3 by NVIDIA
  (https://huggingface.co/nvidia/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3)
- Parakeet Ultra by Moondream
  (https://huggingface.co/moondream/parakeet-ultra)
